 "title": "MPE for Peak",
 "version": "0.5",
 "label": "MPE5 Ver 108.469",
 "summary": "Per-note pitch bend, pressure (channel or poly aftertouch) and slide (MPE) on the Peak's 8 voices, a per-patch MPE switch (VOICE page) and Settings MPE pages; one or two zones. v0.2: the arpeggiator ignores its own notes when a DAW sends them back (MIDI loop). v0.3: turning a knob shows envelope times in ms and the filter cutoff in Hz, with a value bar, and Pickup shows an arrow and a distance bar. v0.4: Settings > MPE > PressCurve chooses stock's squared pressure or a linear curve. v0.5: CC 11 on a member channel works as pressure. Tested on one Peak with the automated hardware test rig and played from a LinnStrument.",
